// Fingerprints the PDF exactly as it will be stored. Sits directly after Generate PDF, because the file can only be
// read from this node's own input item. The file is passed on unchanged.
// SHA-256 in plain JavaScript. Code nodes on this n8n instance may not load the crypto module (checked in execution 63310).
